    "body": "Stopped before claiming. The required RichAuto DSP A11 post from #1914 is absent on upstream/main 6f8b309dcea9ea2c367ecfa53261ed140881bab3. The tree has no richauto.cps, and posting::BUILTINS has no RichAuto entry. Issue #1914 is open and has no open implementation PR to stack on.\n\nThe requested default-post mapping cannot be completed until that dependency exists. The current default_post_for accepts only a machine kind, not a machine model. Adding the post itself would exceed this one-issue assignment. The friend's exact machine specifications also remain unconfirmed in #1907.\n\nOverlap check: #1753 changes posting::MACHINES and every_shipped_machine_mounts_and_speaks_its_declaration. Work on #1915 would need to stack on it while it remains open. #1738 and #1681 touch posting.rs in different functions.\n\nNo claim, branch, code changes, or tests were made.\n",
