    "body": "blocked: waiting on `#1914` (`RichAuto DSP A11` post) and `#1907` (friend's machine confirmation).\n\nChecked `upstream/main` (`31f8d03d`) and all open/merged PRs in `NeoTech/Camcraft`:\n\n- `#1914` is still open with no open or merged PR (`assets/posts/richauto.cps` is absent and `BUILTINS` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs` has no `RichAuto DSP A11` entry).\n- `default_post_for(kind: crate::machine::Kind)` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs` currently dispatches only by machine `Kind`, not by machine model, and cannot resolve `RichAuto DSP A11` until `#1914` registers it in `BUILTINS`.\n- `#1907` has not yet confirmed the friend's machine make, model, table size, Z travel, or spindle limits required by this issue's scope.\n\nOverlap check for when blockers clear:\n- Open PR `#1753` (`merge-ready`) modifies `MACHINES` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs` and `every_shipped_machine_mounts_and_speaks_its_declaration` in `crates/app/tests/machine.rs` (stack on `#1753` if still open).\n- Open PR `#1681` modifies `op_streams` in `crates/app/src/posting.rs` (different function).\n\nAdded label `blocked`. Made no claim, branch, worktree, code change, or PR.\n",
